# 5. The event layer was correct — but needs to begin on Day 1

This was one of the strongest parts of the earlier architecture.

But putting Data as:

> P07 after Sales, Support, CS...

was wrong.

The **analytics product** comes later.

The **event model** comes first.

From the first production workflow:

```json
{
  "event_id": "uuid",
  "event_type": "lead.message.received",
  "occurred_at": "...",
  "entity_id": "...",
  "conversation_id": "...",
  "source": "whatsapp",
  "correlation_id": "...",
  "payload": {}
}
```

Everything important generates events:

```text
Lead created
Lead qualified
Objection detected
Offer made
Checkout created
Payment completed

Student created
Student activated
Student inactive
Support requested

AI responded
AI used tool
AI escalated
Human assumed conversation
```

This gives us historical truth independent of Chatwoot and n8n.

