# 8. Lead state must be deterministic

Don't allow the LLM to be the sole authority for:

```text
lead_stage = WON
```

Create an explicit state machine:

```text
NEW
 │
 ▼
CONTACTED
 │
 ▼
QUALIFYING
 │
 ├────────► DISQUALIFIED
 │
 ▼
QUALIFIED
 │
 ▼
OFFERED
 │
 ▼
CHECKOUT_STARTED
 │
 ├────────► ABANDONED
 │
 ▼
PAID
```

The AI can recommend:

```text
QUALIFIED
```

but deterministic rules or controlled tools update the actual state.

For example:

```text
payment webhook
      ↓
payment.status = PAID
      ↓
lead.stage = WON
```

An LLM should never infer the final sale from conversation text alone.

